#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
duo_events.py - Pokemon Generation III events from the Action Replay MAX DUO's GBA.

The DUO's GBA plays the hardware a distribution used, and the game on a second GBA receives the
event through its own menus and saves it itself. Needs Reckless firmware v4.2 (which runs this
project's programs from the GBA's RAM) and maxduo_saves.py in the same folder (the USB code).
Nothing here reads or writes either cartridge.

    python duo_events.py gift --card FILE.wc3     Mystery Gift: a Wonder Card, as a Wireless Adapter
                                                  with a distributor in range (MGB-010 cable)
    python duo_events.py news --news FILE         Mystery Gift: Wonder News, the same way
    python duo_events.py event --event FILE       Mystery Event: the e-Reader, for Ruby/Sapphire
                                                  (GBA link cable); FILE may be a saved event (.me3)
    python duo_events.py event                    the e-Reader with no event: a dry run
    python duo_events.py adapter-test | probe | find-serial     lab tools

See README.md, docs/DISTRIBUTOR.md and docs/EREADER.md.
"""
